# Regenerable model artefacts and caches. Every one of these is rebuilt by a script in tools/,
# and the measurement that justifies each model lives in docs/results.md, which is what actually
# stops the work being repeated. Roughly 500 MB was committed before this rule existed.
*.pt
*.pt.*
data/*.npz
data/corner_rows.npy
data/constraint_rows.json
data/support_vs_error.json
data/sketchnet_*.npz
!data/embed_centre.npz
data/fusion360_ideal_sketches.json
data/fusion360_probe.json
